@dsh-user/dsh-plugins-folders README · dsh-plugins-folders — DSH 插件栏分组管理：**中文** | [English](README.en.md)

给 DeepSeek Harness 的「插件」页加一层**文件夹**：把装了一堆的插件按用途收进分组，按组开关，一键搜索、拖动排序，卸载了还能从记录里重新装回来。

> 装了几十个插件之后，插件列表就变成一条越来越长的传送带。这个插件不改变任何插件的实际行为，只在插件页上多一层你自己定义的收纳结构——像给抽屉装隔板。

@dsh-user/dsh-plugins-folders README · 使用说明：- 分组只影响这一页的展示，**不改变插件之间的加载顺序或依赖关系**。
- 有的插件由上层配置统一接管，页面改不了它的开关，行上会显示为只读并给出原因——这是如实反映，不是面板失灵。
- 改动即时写入真实插件状态；若某插件需要重启 Harness 才生效，面板会提示「改动已保存，需要重启 Harness 才生效」。

@dsh-user/dsh-plugins-folders README · 兼容与要求：- DeepSeek Harness，Web 端（`platform: web`）；`shell.overlay` 插槽存在即可用。
- 依赖宿主提供的 `slots`、`locale`、`remote.pluginManager` 服务，不额外安装任何 npm 包。
- 需要 DSH 具备插件开关能力（`remote.pluginManager.setBundleEnabled`）；没有时面板会给出明确报错，而不是静默失败。

@dsh-user/dsh-plugins-folders README · dsh-plugins-folders — folders for your DSH plugin list：**English** | [中文](README.md)

A folder layer for the **Plugins** page of DeepSeek Harness: sort installed plugins into groups, flip a whole group on or off, search across groups, drag to reorder, and reinstall anything you removed from its uninstall record.

> After a few dozen plugins the list turns into an ever-growing conveyor belt. This plugin adds your own shelving on top of it — it never changes what a plugin does, only how the page presents it.

@dsh-user/dsh-plugins-folders README · Requirements：- DeepSeek Harness, web platform (`platform: web`); works whenever the `shell.overlay` slot exists.
- Uses the host-provided `slots`, `locale` and `remote.pluginManager` services — no extra npm packages.
- The host must expose `remote.pluginManager.setBundleEnabled`; when it does not, the panel reports a clear error instead of failing silently.
